-- The instrument that first wrote the words "6ל(א)" into s 21ב(ג) was not read, so this row does not say how long the words have stood in subsection (ג); it says that the section was re-marked in 2001 and that the words stand in (ג) as the consolidation prints them.
`re-marking: s 6ל re-marked 21ג, SH 1807 p. 551` MEANS
    `A re-marking` WITH
        `the instrument and its section` IS "s 43 of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 1807 (9 August 2001), printed page 551"
        `the number the section bore before` IS "6ל"
        `the number the instrument gave the section` IS "21ג"
        `the number the citing words cite` IS "6ל"
        `the re-marking was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
        `the number the citing words cite was read from` IS `the consolidation only`

GIVEN r IS A `A re-marking`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the number the words cite is the number the section now bears` MEANS r's `the number the citing words cite` EQUALS r's `the number the instrument gave the section`

`reference: s 21ב(ג), the words that cite s 6ל(א)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "s 21ב(ג), as the consolidation prints it (revision 3099061, line 1655 of the page)"
        `the citing words name` IS "s 6ל, subsection (א)"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `the text of a section that says who represents the owners of the apartments in dealings with the licensee`
        `the target is` IS `a note that the section was re-marked with another number`
        `how many things the citing words name` IS 1
        `how many of them the target has` IS 0
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the official page for the re-marking, the consolidation only for the text of the section it now stands in`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the consolidation only`

