    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "s 21ב(ג) after the instruction (ג) of s 20(1) of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 2933, printed page 159"
        `the citing words name` IS "subsections (ב1), (ב2) and (ב3) of s 21ב"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `subsections (ב1), (ב2) and (ב3) of s 21ב`
        `the target is` IS `subsections (ב1), (ב2) and (ב3) of s 21ב`
        `how many things the citing words name` IS 3
        `how many of them the target has` IS 3
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

§ `I2: the citation of s 6יב2(1) in s 6ח4(ב)`

-- The citing words, as the Act in Sefer HaChukim 1807 (9 August 2001) prints them, read from the deposited cropped images of the pages printed 540 and 541.
