-- The target. The Act in Sefer HaChukim 2985 (4 July 2022), Amendment 76, s 26, read from the deposited cropped image of the page printed 947 (the crop holds the section, its margin note and the footer line, and nothing else of the page):
-- ext:[SH 2985 p.947, read from the deposited cropped image] | ביטול סעיפים 6יב1 עד 6יב4
