-- The row says that the section was repealed by Amendment 76, section 26, and nothing about when the repeal took effect.
`repeal: ss 6יב1 to 6יב4 repealed, SH 2985 p. 947` MEANS
    `A repeal` WITH
        `the instrument and its section` IS "s 26 of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 2985 (4 July 2022), Amendment 76, printed page 947"
        `the stem of the sections repealed` IS "6יב"
        `the first number after the stem that is repealed` IS 1
        `the last number after the stem that is repealed` IS 4
        `the stem of the section the citing words cite` IS "6יב"
        `the number after the stem of the section the citing words cite` IS 2
        `the repeal was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

GIVEN r IS A `A repeal`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the section cited is among the sections repealed` MEANS
    (r's `the stem of the section the citing words cite` EQUALS r's `the stem of the sections repealed`)
    AND (r's `the number after the stem of the section the citing words cite` AT LEAST r's `the first number after the stem that is repealed`)
    AND (r's `the last number after the stem that is repealed` AT LEAST r's `the number after the stem of the section the citing words cite`)

GIVEN r IS A `A repeal`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the section cited stands outside the repealed numbers` MEANS NOT `the section cited is among the sections repealed` r

`period: the carve-out of s 6ח4(ב)` MEANS
    `A period` WITH
        `what the period is` IS "the time for which s 6ח4(ב) lets the person hold means of control, as the sentence words it"
        `how many years it runs for` IS 8
        `what it runs from` IS "the commencement of Amendment 25"
        `the day it runs from was read` IS FALSE
        `the period was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

`reference: s 6ח4(ב), the words that cite s 6יב2(1)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "s 6ח4(ב) as the Act in Sefer HaChukim 1807 prints it, printed page 541"
        `the citing words name` IS "s 6יב2, paragraph (1)"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `the text of a paragraph that states a way of acting`
        `the target is` IS `a section repealed by another instrument`
        `how many things the citing words name` IS 1
        `how many of them the target has` IS 0
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

